flowchart TD
NSGA_Optimizer["**NSGA II Optimizer**<br/>run_nsga2_optimization<br/>configures algorithm sampling crossover mutation"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>defines decision variables caps for 6 DelayBuffers<br/>implements _evaluate to compute objectives"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>6 buffer capacities<br/>domain {1-10} integer"]
GeneticOps["**Genetic Operators**<br/>IntegerRandomSampling SBX PM<br/>population and termination settings"]
EvalPool["**Evaluator Pool**<br/>multiprocessing Pool size {50}<br/>maps evaluations in parallel"]
IndividualEval["**Individual Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>runs n replications per candidate"]
SimRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps<br/>builds sim using caps and returns metrics"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer**<br/>attribute cap set from decision variable<br/>methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>creates machines with process_time availability mttr<br/>records throughput wip energy stats"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>f1 average WIP to minimize<br/>f2 negative throughput to minimize"]
HistoryExporter["**History Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>writes population history to CSV"]
ParetoFront["**Pareto Front**<br/>result of minimize<br/>final trade off set of solutions"]

NSGA_Optimizer -->|creates| BufferProblem
NSGA_Optimizer -->|uses| GeneticOps
BufferProblem -->|receives candidates X| DecisionVars
BufferProblem -->|parallel evaluate| EvalPool
EvalPool -->|maps to| IndividualEval
IndividualEval -->|calls| SimRunner
SimRunner -->|constructs| DelayBuffer
SimRunner -->|constructs| MachineClass
DelayBuffer -->|provides behavior to| MachineClass
SimRunner -->|returns metrics throughput and wip to| IndividualEval
IndividualEval -->|aggregates replications and returns objectives to| EvalPool
EvalPool -->|returns results F to| BufferProblem
BufferProblem -->|provides objectives to| NSGA_Optimizer
NSGA_Optimizer -->|updates population and generations| ParetoFront
ParetoFront -->|final archive sent to| HistoryExporter
HistoryExporter -->|exports CSV of generations and KPIs| ParetoFront
Objectives -->|defined in| BufferProblem
DecisionVars -->|encoded in population by| GeneticOps